## Key Principles
- **TypeScript Strict Mode**: Maintain type safety throughout the codebase
- **Import Management**: Prevent dependency cycles and maintain clean import structure
- **Component Priority**: Use local components first, then rn-base-component
- **Redux Saga**: Use for all async operations and side effects
- **Expo Router**: File-based routing with proper structure

This master rule ensures comprehensive adherence to all established development standards.